{"title":"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_TechMath_Thinker\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by TechMath Thinker</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In rhombus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />, point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> lies on segment <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/b/f4bb1db3d066da48df7576e30ef3831ec64cecc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{BP}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/9/5/29501a90018e83d6d3e88b1f83bdfb71e692561e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\perp$\" width=\"13\" height=\"12\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/b/cfbb4c52e011ceed6e813118a7d59e931af444a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\overline{AD}$\" width=\"29\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/c/86c5def47ea9d51fe73ca3b15a86414585812930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP = 3$\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/a/31ae82ddb78910d9b4b4da47c9262cc24f1166f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PD = 2$\" width=\"62\" height=\"12\" />. What is the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" />? (Note: The figure is not drawn to scale.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/0/150aeac95fbc38e4ea6602817ade871e681d99e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] import olympiad; size(180); real r = 3, s = 5, t = sqrt(r*r+s*s); defaultpen(linewidth(0.6) + fontsize(10)); pair A = (0,0), B = (r,s), C = (r+t,s), D = (t,0), P = (r,0); draw(A--B--C--D--A^^B--P^^rightanglemark(B,P,D)); label(&quot;$A$&quot;,A,SW); label(&quot;$B$&quot;, B, NW); label(&quot;$C$&quot;,C,NE); label(&quot;$D$&quot;,D,SE); label(&quot;$P$&quot;,P,S); [/asy]\" width=\"302\" height=\"185\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c13204d0ebe9d9d1d1681b6f8b8effd4ca33b61.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }3\\sqrt 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(B) }10 \\qquad \\textbf{(C) }6\\sqrt 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(D) }20\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"431\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/2/9227d5b4a9d1cd8785897b118eae231dfaf92d2a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AD = AP + PD = 3 + 2 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"286\" height=\"16\" />.\nNow, because the question tells us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/e/f9efaf9474c5658c4089523e2aff4e11488f8603.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABCD$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"60\" height=\"14\" /> is a rhombus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/a/36a74098ee9550bd91796b54bbdb365cff47dae4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC = AB = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"117\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, by Pythagorean Theorem on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92b38136cabb69ee2f7b5711190e0042354f3419.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$APB$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df59748e8ca83e7e10721e5b328409e27cb2707f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"62\" height=\"13\" />.\nTherefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/4/f043dfd0f57fde78d992447af9a1554fdcd1b0b7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ABCD] = AD \\times BP = 5 \\times 4 = \\boxed{\\text{D 20}}\\]\" width=\"306\" height=\"23\" />\n~DUODUOLUO(First time using <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/latex.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\LaTeX$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"46\" height=\"15\" />, may have some minor mistakes)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xXov8GF99ac?si=d6jkg20I-fd1EuT1\">https://youtu.be/xXov8GF99ac?si=d6jkg20I-fd1EuT1</a>\n</p><p>~Ani_lytical\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_TechMath_Thinker\">Video Solution by TechMath Thinker</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by TechMath Thinker\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/e-8oXKHlNM0\">https://youtu.be/e-8oXKHlNM0</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B\">2022 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/in